      "content": "Interesting. So if we're leaning into that \"slide toward authoritarianism\" angle, what's the most compelling way to frame it so it doesn't just sound like partisan talking points, but like an inescapable logical conclusion? Basically, how do we prove that their economic model inevitably leads to a loss of personal freedom?",
